#: ../../functions/func_find.rst:6
msgid "$find"
msgstr ""

#: ../../functions/func_find.rst:8
msgid "Usage: **$find(haystack,needle)**"
msgstr "用法：**$find(haystack,needle)**"

#: ../../functions/func_find.rst:9
msgid "Category: text"
msgstr "类别：文本"

#: ../../functions/func_find.rst:10
msgid "Implemented: Picard 2.3"
msgstr "实现：Picard 2.3"

#: ../../functions/func_find.rst:12
msgid "**Description:**"
msgstr "**描述：**"

#: ../../functions/func_find.rst:14
msgid "Returns the zero-based index of the first occurrence of ``needle`` in ``haystack``, or an empty string if ``needle`` was not found. The comparisons are case-sensitive. If ``needle`` is blank, it will match the beginning of ``haystack`` and return \"0\". The function does not support wildcards."
msgstr ""
"返回 ``needle`` 在 ``haystack`` 中第一次出现的位置的零基索引，如果未找到 "
"``needle``，则返回空字符串。比较是区分大小写的。如果 ``needle`` 为空，则将匹"
"配 ``haystack`` 的开头并返回 \"0\"。该函数不支持通配符。"

#: ../../functions/func_find.rst:18
msgid "Prior to Picard 2.3.2 ``$find`` returned \"-1\" if ``needle`` was not found."
msgstr "在 Picard 2.3.2 之前，如果未找到 ``needle``，``$find`` 将返回 \"-1\"。"

